OL,3,A'Our flat has been for sale for four
OL,4,Ayears': Why is the market so weak?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2015, thousands of people queued
OL,7,Fovernight in the rain to reserve and
OL,8,Fbuy studio apartments selling for under
OL,9,F#200,000 in Hounslow, west London.
OL,11,FIt's in stark contrast to today's
OL,12,Fappetite for flats, with property
OL,13,Fportals reporting a slump in sales.
OL,15,FBut why, when the country is in a
OL,16,Fhousing crisis with a desperate need
OL,17,Ffor affordable homes, are flats now
OL,18,Fstruggling to sell?
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
