OL,3,A'Our flat has been for sale for four
OL,4,Ayears': Why is the market so weak?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the property site Zoopla,
OL,7,F88% of flats listed for sale in inner
OL,8,FLondon on its website in 2025 did not
OL,9,Ffind a buyer within six months. The
OL,10,Fcompany also says the gap between the
OL,11,Fvalue of a flat and a house is the
OL,12,Fwidest it has been for 30 years.
